{"sourceUrl":"https://math.szu.edu.cn/info/1036/8326.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:58.362281+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://math.szu.edu.cn/info/1036/8326.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>为增进优秀大学生对深圳大学数学</span><span>科学</span><span><span>学院以及招生学科的了解，同时选拔有培养潜质的优秀大学生攻读研究生，学院将于</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7月</span><span>14</span><span><span>日</span><span>-</span></span><span>16</span><span><span>日在深圳大学举办暑期学校活动，对</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>级推免硕</span><span>士生和直博生进行提前选拔。欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></p><p><span>一、</span><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>070100 数学</span><span>（</span><span>含</span><span>直博研究生</span><span>）</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>071400 统计学</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>025200应用统计</span></p><p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span>报名对象</span></strong></p><p><span>1.全国高校本科三年级在校生（20</span><span>27</span><span>届本科毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2.就读于数学、统计学、应用统计学等相关专业；</span></p><p><span>3.具有强烈的学习创新意识，学习成绩优异，科研发展潜力突出，英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>4.遵纪守法、品行端正、举止文明</span><span>、</span><span>身心健康。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、活动安排</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>活动时间：</span><span>7月14日报到，</span><span>7月</span><span>15-16</span><span>日</span><span>正式</span><span>活动</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>活动安排：开</span><span>幕</span><span>仪式、各专业介绍、科研讲座、优秀</span><span>研究</span><span>生经验分享</span><span>、</span><span>师生交流等</span><span>（</span><span>拟定</span><span>）</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>活动费用：暑期学校以线下方式举行，学院将为异地学校学</span><span>员提供</span><span>暑期学校</span><span>期间在深圳的免费食宿，并给予</span><span>8</span><span>00元的路费报销</span><span>额度</span><span>（</span><span>仅限高铁二等票、汽车票</span><span>）。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿及路费报销，仅提供免费用餐。</span></p><p><span>注意：</span><span>活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；学员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、报名方式</span></strong></p><p><span>有意向申请的同学须在</span><span>“</span><a href=\"http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>深圳大学</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生推免预报名</span><span>/暑期学校报名</span></span></a><span>系统</span><span>”进行报名，网址：http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm，并按系统要求提交本人</span><span>以下</span><span>各项</span><span>材料</span><span>：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）身份证正反面扫描件或者照片；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）学生证扫描件或者照片；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>5）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>网上申请截止时间：</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>29</span><span>日</span><span>，届时将视情况而定是否延期。</span></p><p><span><span>注意：</span><span>1.系统填报时记得勾选左下方的“报名暑期学校项目”。2.“该系统在7月1日前仅限暑期学校报名，7月1日后开放推免生预报名。”</span></span></p><p><span>五、</span><strong><span>审核选拔</span></strong></p><p><span>申请截止后，招生审核工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将以电子邮件或网上公示的形式通知公布。</span></p><p><span>六、</span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span><span>咨询电话：刘老师</span>    <span>0755-2673 3396</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院官网：</span><span>http://math.szu.edu.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年微信研招群：</span></span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://math.szu.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zMzflVM47DL47snrRUaLzV7LlrRL8-IaLm98MzM7oRNPnNl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDMYybMSh2LRV7MNUsL7W2MRL4UNMkLmVVUzUbUzrkM7rFnmGDollZn7MFMRvDMRLJv2bjo4OeoDiA629YLR-4gDTJQty0LzG4M1yZL4-DgtA8pU5cc&amp;oid=1941947911&amp;tid=1036&amp;nid=8326&amp;e=.png\"/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"4f31eb3d968c90b08dca956e0cf0e377a2aac9f3131852ce295c09e614a20f1a","textLength":967,"sourceSha256":"2a3ffed10227c9e63bf61efd367c7d40b514c0d6b56dd8d3b2003d58bdfc33a3","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"